warning[remove_in_for]: `array_unordered_remove_by_index` changes `xs` while this `for` walks it
  --> tests/lint/remove_in_for/bad.jai:7:20
   |
 7 |         if it == 2 array_unordered_remove_by_index(*xs, it_index);
   |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: the element moved into the freed slot is skipped; use `remove it;` (or loop backwards with `for < xs`)
   = note: `remove_in_for` is `warn` by default

